
    * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *
    WARNING : do not be surprised by really long runtimes
    * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *

see https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pollard%27s_rho_algorithm

